Package: av
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: jegly <jjjegly@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libasound2t64, libdrm2, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libgl1, libglib2.0-0t64, libglx0, libharfbuzz0b, libnotify4, libpulse0, libsqlite3-0, libudev1, libva-drm2, libva-wayland2, libva-x11-2, libva2, libvdpau1, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb-dri3-0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxcursor1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxrandr2, zlib1g, libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6, libqt6widgets6, libqt6qml6, libqt6quick6, libqt6quickcontrols2-6, libqt6svg6, qt6-svg-plugins, libqt6opengl6, libqt6network6, qt6-qpa-plugins, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
Recommends: pipewire, dbus-x11, fonts-freefont-ttf
Homepage: https://github.com/jegly/AV
Description: local-only audio and video player
 AV plays audio and video files from your own machine and nothing else.
 It does not stream, cast, serve, browse network shares, fetch metadata,
 or check for updates.
 .
 Every module capable of opening a network socket is removed from the
 build, so no network access is possible regardless of what the
 application does. AV is an independent fork of VLC and is not
 affiliated with or endorsed by VideoLAN.
 .
 Requires an x86-64-v3 CPU (Haswell, 2013, or newer): the build targets
 AVX2/BMI2/FMA and will abort with an illegal instruction on older
 hardware.
